<div class="sect2">
<h3 id="component"><a class="link" href="#component">ComponentDescriptor</a></h3>
<div class="paragraph">
<p>Base shape shared by <a href="#page"><code>PageDescriptor</code></a>, <a href="#part"><code>PartDescriptor</code></a> and <a href="#layout"><code>LayoutDescriptor</code></a>. <code>getComponent</code>, <code>createComponent</code>, <code>updateComponent</code> and <code>listComponents</code> always return one of those concrete types depending on the <code>type</code> argument.</p>
</div>
<div class="paragraph lead">
<p>Type</p>
</div>
<div class="paragraph">
<p><strong>object</strong></p>
</div>
<div class="paragraph lead">
<p>Properties</p>
</div>
<table class="tableblock frame-none grid-none stretch">
<colgroup>
<col style="width: 1%;">
<col style="width: 1%;">
<col style="width: 98%;">
</colgroup>
<thead>
<tr>
